Keys                                                                           ✕
Enter                       send Send a prompt, or a steering message during a t
Shift+Enter, Ctrl+J         line_break Insert a line break
Esc                         close_or_interrupt Close what is on top; interrupt t
Ctrl+C                      clear_then_quit Clear the draft, then quit
⌥0                          go_home Go home
Ctrl+N                      new_session Start a new session
⌥1 ⌥2 ⌥3 ⌥4 ⌥5 ⌥6 ⌥7 ⌥8 ⌥9  rail_row_n Switch to the session of rail card N
Delete, Backspace           delete_session Delete the selected exited session in
↑                           recall_prompt Recall an earlier prompt from the proj
Ctrl+R                      search_prompts Search those prompts
⌥← ⌥→, Ctrl+← Ctrl+→, ⌥B ⌥F move_word Move by word
⌥Backspace                  delete_word Delete a word
⌘← ⌘→                       line_start_end Start or end of the line
Ctrl+G                      open_in_editor Open the draft, or a pasted token, in
Ctrl+V                      paste_image Paste an image
Ctrl+O                      toggle_ledgers Open or close the ledgers
Shift+Tab                   navigate Move focus from the input box into the conv
↓ ↑, j k                    focus_next_prev Move focus to the next or previous i
Not saved: disk full
↑↓ move · Enter rebind · r reset · Delete unbind · Esc close
